{
  "$comment": "两端共用的设计真源。Android 映射到 core/designsystem，iOS 后续映射到 SwiftUI。色值对齐现有 Web 端视觉。",
  "color": {
    "brand": {
      "primary": "#2563EB",
      "primaryDark": "#1D4ED8",
